<title>USA: Adelphia's Hyperion completes debt offer.</title>
<headline>Adelphia's Hyperion completes debt offer.</headline>
<dateline>COUDERSPORT, Pa. 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hyperion Telecommunications Inc, an 89-percent owned unit of Adelphia Communications Corp, said on Monday that Hyperion's exchange offer of $329 million of its registered 13 percent senior discount notes due 2003, Series B is complete.</p>
<p>Hyperion has accepted the tender of $329 million of old notes and will issue new notes in the same amount as of September 12, 1996, the company said.</p>
<p>The differences in the series of notes could not immediately be determined.</p>
</text>
